WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:09.060
Worth noting is that this is the year we are growing the top line of the company through the largest LOE period that the company has seen.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:18.620
Core net financial expense will be one will be around one point seven billion dollars and core tax rate would be about sixteen and a half percent.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.740
And these two parameters are consistent with our previous estimates.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.420
Like twenty two.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:31.400
Please continue to expect twenty twenty six to be a year of two halves.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:37.200
Each one growth will be impacted by a tough previous year base following U.S.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.720
generic increase for interest.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.740
So come out and the signal made last year.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:53.620
And with that in the base, we had guided each one sales to decline low single digit and core operating to decline low double digits with our Q1 results.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.420
Now in the bank, we are on track to meet that guidance.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:05.860
With Q2 sales expected to decline low single digit and core operating expected to decline high single digit to low double digit.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.280
In half to the impact of the U.S.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:18.320
Generic entries in the base will start to minimize and this will allow strong growth of our priority brands and launches to show through the overall P&L.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:26.740
And hence, we continue to expect edge to sales growth of mid single digit and core operating growth of mid to high single digit.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.420
And that brings us to our folio guidance.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.380
Next slide, please.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:47.970
If exchange rates remain at late April levels, we expect positive plus two percent impact on folio sales and positive one percent on full folio core operating income.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:53.790
As a reminder, updated exchange rate assumptions are published monthly on our Web site.

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.470
And then that concludes my remarks and I'll hand it back to us.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:58.450
Great.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:01:59.730
Thank you, McCool.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.730
And welcome as well, McCool, for his first question.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.450
Thank you so much, and my pleasure.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.730
Thank you all for being here today.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:15.630
So overall, we've delivered a strong start in 2026 across our priority brands and launches and we remain fully confident with our mid to long term growth outlook.

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:22.570
We continue to advance our pipeline, completed the ability acquisition and are well set up for multiple readouts in the second half.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.230
Remain on track to deliver our folio guidance.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:31.050
And we'll also look forward to those readouts, which could enable us to raise our mid to long term growth outlook.

